_paragraph\" >MEGAL\u00d8DON / xi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u30ca\u30a4\u30c8\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30b3(MASH VP! Re:VISION EDIT) / Hmt2 feat.\u97f3\u9375\u3081\u308d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRYSMILE (feat.coralmines &amp; RANASOL)  / alleyy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOVESICK BABY / MINIKOMA\u2606</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMAGE REBORN -DIVINITY- / Tatsh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Additional mashup tracks will also be added to MASH UP mode:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eXemetis / Tatsh\u300f x \u300eHUNG ON / MisfortuneCrew with sak\u300f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eAthena / \u5343\u672c\u677e \u4ec1\u300f x \u300eOracle / ASR feat. sak\u300f x \u300ethe end of confusion / \u30bb\u30ac\u30fc\u30eb\u5927\u4f50\u300f</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099750/extras/d8873596cdb752d023e2f42c104e44d5.avif?t=1761290302\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes the in-game System Theme as a downloadable bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099750?t=1761290302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099750?t=1761290302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099750/1b4154c8043c2b2aae513db16afcc9e529f80872/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761290302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099750/1b4154c8043c2b2aae513db16afcc9e529f80872/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761290302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":